    "name": "Red Nose Guy Gauntlet Inc. The burnout",
    "steam_appid": 3358980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/62412e116491fbb310f87aee8e06c448.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/62412e116491fbb310f87aee8e06c448.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/62412e116491fbb310f87aee8e06c448.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN WORK DEVOURS YOU\u2026 FIGHT BACK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Gauntlet Inc.</strong>, a company where deadlines are impossible, files pile up endlessly, and burnout is the only guaranteed promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Nose Guy \u2013 RNG</strong> is the model employee. Work, commute, sleep. Later and later, lonelier and lonelier. It\u2019s 11 PM, and he\u2019s still stuck in the open space, buried under files\u2026 until his mind snaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He pushes his desk. He snaps. The walls shake. The horror begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/45dbe6165c6f401de0338e73f0370a4f.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/45dbe6165c6f401de0338e73f0370a4f.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/45dbe6165c6f401de0338e73f0370a4f.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TWIN-STICK SHOOTER WHERE WORK IS THE ENEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauntlet Inc. is more than just a shooter \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic system where the company itself becomes your enemy. Every opponent follows a ruthless bureaucratic logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a state of total burnout, RNG starts hallucinating. Files turn into monsters, printers launch deadly paper planes, and the company\u2019s products become destructive weapons. The entire office turns against him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a maze of absurd open spaces, survive waves of enraged employees, deactivate demonic printers, and bring down corrupt hierarchies. Each floor is a bureaucratic nightmare, and the elevator is your only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGIC, FAST-PACED, AND EVOLVING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Managerial hierarchy</strong>: Every enemy can evolve and get promoted if not stopped in time. Eliminate the bosses to disrupt squads and prevent major threats from emerging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply chain</strong>: Enemies feed on documents, coffee, and internal resources. Sabotage their system, hijack their logistics, and turn their organization against them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company meetings</strong>: Every 3 minutes, a crisis meeting is held. Intervene to blow everything up, sabotage the room, or let it happen (at your own risk).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploitable bureaucracy</strong>: Even demons follow protocol. Predict their actions, hack their systems, and twist their absurd routines to your advantage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/e3a6bb9f18f69e55989a48725396060c.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/e3a6bb9f18f69e55989a48725396060c.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/e3a6bb9f18f69e55989a48725396060c.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DEEPER RNG DESCENDS INTO MADNESS, THE STRONGER HE BECOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Every floor brings RNG closer to breaking point\u2026 but also closer to his full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powers inspired by corporate absurdity, unleash special attacks born from mental overload, and turn hallucinations into weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this company, work literally kills.\u00a0<strong>Will you resign\u2026 or will you fight back?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/624984a6c507dd2bacd31069e549d5a4.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/624984a6c507dd2bacd31069e549d5a4.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/624984a6c507dd2bacd31069e549d5a4.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
