TER WHERE WORK IS THE ENEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gauntlet Inc. is more than just a shooter \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic system where the company itself becomes your enemy. Every opponent follows a ruthless bureaucratic logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a state of total burnout, RNG starts hallucinating. Files turn into monsters, printers launch deadly paper planes, and the company\u2019s products become destructive weapons. The entire office turns against him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a maze of absurd open spaces, survive waves of enraged employees, deactivate demonic printers, and bring down corrupt hierarchies. Each floor is a bureaucratic nightmare, and the elevator is your only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.poster.avif?t=1744811657\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.webm?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358980/extras/7d277ef3dd4be168a855cef3a928f147.mp4?t=1744811657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGIC, FAST-PACED, AND EVOLVING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Managerial hierarchy</strong>: Every enemy can evolve and get promoted if not stopped in time. Eliminate the bosses to disrupt squads and prevent major threats from emerging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply chain</strong>: Enemies feed on documents, coffee, and internal resources. Sabotage their system, hijack their logistics, and turn their organization against them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company meetings</str